Question: For a college orientation fair, the Eagle Meets Bear Club is printing t -shirts. The cost of the t -shirt paper is $3 per ream for the first 50 reams ordered, and $2.50 per ream for any additional reams. There is also a flat shipping and handling fee of $15. If the club orders 90 reams of paper, what will be the total cost?
